{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-tropical","title":"为何热带几何","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/foundations/why-tropical","wordCount":1675,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"min-plus-semiring","title":"min-plus 半环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/foundations/min-plus-semiring","wordCount":1414,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"tropicalization","title":"热带化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/tropical-geometry/foundations/tropicalization","wordCount":1612,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础\">基础</h1><p>热带几何的门槛不在几何，而在于愿不愿意接受一套「残缺」的算术：能加不能减，能乘不能除的那个「乘」其实是加法。本章的任务，就是把这套算术从直觉、公理到与经典几何的桥梁，一次讲清楚，让后面三章可以直接站在它上面。</p>\n<p>三篇文档回答三个层层递进的问题。<a href=\"why-tropical\">为何热带几何</a> 回答「动机」：为什么值得把光滑的代数曲线拍扁成折线，这样做丢了什么、又换来了什么，以及「热带」这个古怪名字的来历。<a href=\"min-plus-semiring\">min-plus 半环</a> 回答「用什么算」：把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⊕</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oplus=\\min</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⊗</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\otimes=+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 的半环公理摆开，说清幂等性、无逆元这些反常之处，以及 min-plus 与 max-plus 两个约定的关系。<a href=\"tropicalization\">热带化</a> 回答「桥在哪」：用域上的赋值、Puiseux 级数和 Maslov 反量子化，把经典多项式与簇「投影」成热带对象的机制交代清楚。</p>\n<p>本章是全 hub 的公共前提。读完这三篇，你会拥有阅读<a href=\"../curves/\">曲线</a>章所需的全部语言，也会明白<a href=\"../theory/\">理论</a>章的基本定理到底在焊接哪三样东西。若你只想快速上手应用，至少要读完 min-plus 半环一篇，因为<a href=\"../practice/\">应用</a>章的调度与线性代数完全建立在它之上。前置知识仅需线性代数与对多项式的基本熟悉；赋值一节会用到域的概念，可按需回查 <a href=\"../../abstract-algebra/\">18_abstract-algebra</a>。</p>\n"}